WEBVTT

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.210
Hey, could you turn down
the volume just a bit more?

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:27.460
Wha?

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.170
The volume!

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.630
Say wha?

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:32.380
Never mind!

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:34.790
This is all for us?

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:38.130
Do they think there're like
a hundred people in this club?

00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:40.170
I told them we didn't need it.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:43.210
But my grandpa told me to take it.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:46.630
It's hot. I'm getting burned.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.670
How many pairs of underwear did you bring?

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.290
What are you, five? It's not a field trip.

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:54.170
Well, this is my first training camp.

00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:56.210
No, really. How many pairs did you bring?

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.750
I don't know. My grandma packed them for me.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.790
Wait, you didn't pack for yourself?

00:01:02.790 --> 00:01:05.090
Who are you calling five again?

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:08.040
I packed this one.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:09.920
I have no idea what she put in that one.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:14.670
Huh... You're a bit extreme.

00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.090
I'm quitting.

00:01:19.090 --> 00:01:23.670
I don't want to play volleyball with someone
like Haijima who ruins the mood.

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:26.670
I want to actually enjoy club activities.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:27.600
I'm sure you--

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.420
I'm going to play.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:32.130
I want to play volleyball with Haijima.

00:01:35.630 --> 00:01:37.210
What?

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:39.750
Nothing.

00:01:39.750 --> 00:01:41.380
It's nothing.

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.710
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:48.090
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:53.090
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

