00:11:13.670 --> 00:11:15.750
Crap. I forgot the detergent.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.630
It's just you?

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:24.880
Can I borrow some detergent?

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:28.540
Actually, just give me your laundry.
We can do a load together.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.790
Here. Since you paid for the laundry.

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:54.290
Oh, your arm...

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:56.210
Yeah.

00:11:56.210 --> 00:11:59.540
I'm not apologizing about it...
It wasn't my fault.

00:11:59.540 --> 00:12:03.380
You don't have to apologize.
Just practice properly.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:05.750
Practice properly?!

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:11.210
You don't plan to set to me at all, do you?

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:14.040
You made it loud and clear what you think of me.

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.130
Don't worry. It's over.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:19.500
Oh, right. You still think...

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:20.590
What?

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:25.420
I'll get back on my game.

00:12:25.420 --> 00:12:30.750
So don't judge me for the past...

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:34.000
I want to be your ace...

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:37.340
I really... do...

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:42.540
Never mind.

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:46.170
You seem to have some kind of misunderstanding.

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:50.000
You're pretty much our team's ace.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:54.250
Training Camp Day 5

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:58.340
The one on our team who can hit
the highest, fastest, and strongest...

00:12:58.340 --> 00:13:00.130
...is you, Kuroba.

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:04.250
You're the only one who can be our ace.

00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:06.090
The others know that, too.

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:17.290
In the middle school tournament,
you're the only one we had.

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:21.000
So I ended up pushing you too far.

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:25.590
But now, the rest of the team
is better than you.

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:29.130
So this time, things will be different.

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:32.130
I'll never let that mistake happen again.

00:13:32.130 --> 00:13:34.630
We're doing things differently this time.

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:38.290
I'll prove it to you at the Fall Tournament.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:43.250
All of my sets to you will be
nothing but the best.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:45.880
I can't wait...

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:48.840
...until the Fall Tournament!

00:13:51.930 --> 00:13:55.930
"[Combination Attacks]
A strategy where the hitters
do multiple attacks at once
to fool the other team's blockers."

00:13:55.930 --> 00:13:58.730
8/2

